<!--
  The main menu in the headset (sdk/menus.js), opened from the button on your left wrist (sdk/wrist.js). Drawn as a
  flat VR menu: 1 UIKit px is one of Meta's dp (1/16 of a degree) where the menu stands, 0.48 m away, so the whole
  menu is 430 x 560 px (22.5 x 29.3 cm). The site's colors (styles.css) and Jost.

    TITLE      430 x 80, "MAIN MENU" in Jost regular, 36 px, cream on dark brown. The ✕ sits on its right corner,
               a red circle 48 px across (25 mm: Meta's 22 mm target), drawn over the menu (z-index 1: no more, or a
               fingertip picks it from further away: sdk/panels.js fairTouch).
    CENTERED   UIKit sets a line of Jost a little high in its box (about 0.28 of its size), so each button's words
               are pushed down by half their padding-top (16 px at 30 px) to sit in the middle. Their words
               span the whole button, centered, and never break onto a second line (word-break: keep-all).
    BUTTONS    380 x 80 (42 mm tall), dark brown with a 5 px cream stroke and 5 px corners; their words in Jost
               regular, cream. 24 px (12.6 mm) apart: Meta's 12 mm between targets.
    EXIT       the same size, red with a 5 px dark brown stroke and 30 px corners, its words in Jost italic (set in
               sdk/menus.js: UIKitML only takes its own font names, and Jost italic is made in sdk/fonts.js).

  TAPPING (sdk/input.js tappable): each button is one pressable thing, words included. Its `press` sits on the
  button itself (set in sdk/menus.js), and a tap that begins on the words and ends on the button's edge (or the other
  way round) still counts. The words are never pressable on their own. Nothing here scrolls, so a tap is never taken
  for a drag of the page. The panel needs the ids page, title and close (sdk/panels.js).
-->
<style>
  .panel {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 430px;
    height: 560px;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .bar {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 80px;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-top-left-radius: 6px;
    border-top-right-radius: 6px;
  }
  .title {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .close {
    z-index: 1;
    position-type: absolute;
    position-top: -14px;
    position-right: -14px;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-width: 4px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .close:hover {
    background-color: #a8382d;
  }
  .close:active {
    background-color: #6e2019;
  }
  .x {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: medium;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 7px;
  }
  .page {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding-top: 30px;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .button {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 380px;
    height: 80px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #F2E8D5;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .button:hover {
    background-color: #4a3222;
  }
  .button:active {
    background-color: #6b4a36;
  }
  .exit {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 380px;
    height: 80px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 30px;
  }
  .exit:hover {
    background-color: #a8382d;
  }
  .exit:active {
    background-color: #6e2019;
  }
  .label {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: normal;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    word-break: keep-all;
    padding-top: 16px;
  }
</style>
<div id="panel" class="panel">
  <div class="bar">
    <span id="title" class="title">MAIN MENU</span>
  </div>
  <div id="page" class="page">
    <div id="overview" class="button"><span id="overview-label" class="label">Overview Panel</span></div>
    <div id="map" class="button"><span id="map-label" class="label">Map Position</span></div>
    <div id="debug" class="button"><span id="debug-label" class="label">Debug Menu</span></div>
    <div id="exit" class="exit"><span id="exit-label" class="label">Exit VR Mode</span></div>
  </div>
  <div id="close" class="close"><span class="x">X</span></div>
</div>
